forwarder and delegates to this state's own constructor, so the reconciler drives its control
exactly as this state does. No production code in this state reads or calls any of them.

Test helpers, before-API variants (passed through this patch, not as overlays):
ManagedChatSeam without its ChildControl branch (this state's factory takes ManagedChildRegistry;
the named checks never pass a ChildControl), and SlowStartFakeLlamaServer with ProcessHandle in
place of ProcessTerminator for its fixture identity and cleanup (start-instant identity, the
candidate's own fallback form). Neither changes an assertion.

